   * 4. Delete all edit history records associated with the todo from multi_user_todo_edit_histories table
   * 5. Delete the trash entry from multi_user_todo_todo_trash_entries table
   * 6. Delete the todo record from multi_user_todo_todos table
   * 7. Commit transaction
   * 8. Return success response
   *
   * If any step fails, rollback the entire transaction and return appropriate error.
   * Ensure proper audit trail logging for the permanent deletion operation.
